{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/manage/baggage/special-baggage","status":200,"title":"Saudia Special Baggage Guide and Rules | Saudia","desc":"Find Saudia special baggage policies for sports equipment, musical instruments, and oversized items. Prepare your travel and request special baggage support today.","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/manage/baggage/special-baggage","bodyClass":"baseLang withTravelNotice mWebHomePage light-theme","h":6310,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-image-link-list"],"h":600,"headings":1,"imgs":1,"text":41},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":2455,"headings":10,"imgs":0,"text":3461},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-space"],"h":56,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":0},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-tabs"],"h":804,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":3574},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":133,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":264},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-faq"],"h":742,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":1384}],"h1":["Saudia Special Baggage Guide and Rules | Saudia","Saudia Special Baggage Allowance & Policy"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel imagelinklist--content-embedded h--left v--top image--slider ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"special baggage\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/baggage/special-baggage-web.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=9b431373fa48464890660d950fd3470f&amp;hash=EF22989E0BA228D6C278628C908F991D\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"f6a817b8-4a9c-40d9-a3a5-dad6d0f61d67\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Saudia Special Baggage Allowance &amp; Policy</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<h2>Special baggage allowance for guests with disabilities</h2>\n<!-- Wheelchairs and mobility aids -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h3>Wheelchairs and mobility aids</h3>\n<p>\nGuests who use wheelchairs or crutches may transport these mobility aids free of charge.\n</p>\n<p>\nWheelchairs and crutches are normally checked and carried in the aircraft hold. They must be handed over before boarding and will be returned upon arrival according to airport procedures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- Medical equipment -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h3>Medical equipment</h3>\n<p>\nSaudia accepts up to two pieces of mobility equipment per guest with a disability or reduced mobility, including electric wheelchairs, in addition to the standard free checked baggage allowance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- Dialysis devices -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h3>Dialysis devices</h3>\n<p>\nGuests who rely on a portable dialysis device may carry one device free of charge.\n</p>\n<p>\nThe device must be checked and placed in the aircraft hold in line with safety and handling procedures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 1. Free baggage for guests with disabilities -->\n<!-- 2. Guide dogs -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h3>Guide Dog Travel Requirements</h3>\n<p>\nGuide dogs may accompany blind or deaf guests. They may be transported in the aircraft hold, provided they are in an appropriate kennel or cage in line with animal transport regulations.\n</p>\n<p>\nGuide dogs are not permitted in the cabin on Saudia flights.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 3. Infant strollers -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h2>Special Baggage allowance for Passengers travelling with infants</h2>\n<h3>Infant strollers</h3>\n<p>\nInfant strollers may be checked in free of charge in line with Saudia’s baggage policy and will be carried in the aircraft hold.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 4. Sports equipment & musical instruments -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h2>Special Baggage allowance for Passengers travelling with Sports equipment and musical instruments</h2>\n<h3>Sports Equipment &amp; Musical Instruments Policy</h3>\n<p>\nSaudia accepts sports equipment and musical instruments as checked baggage if they are properly packed or placed in suitable protective bags or cases, and if airport facilities allow handling of such items.\n</p>\n<p>\nThe weight of these items is counted as part of the guest’s free checked baggage allowance. If the weight and/or dimensions exceed the standard free allowance, excess baggage charges will apply in line with Saudia’s baggage policy.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 5. Medical oxygen services / POC (moved to last) -->\n<div class=\"sb-section\">\n<h2>Portable Oxygen Concentrator (POC) &amp; Medical Oxygen Services</h2>\n<p>\nIn line with international regulations and the General Authority of Civil Aviation (GACAR 91.225),\nguests with special medical needs may use an approved Portable Oxygen Concentrator (POC) during the flight.\nThe following conditions apply to the acceptance and use of POC devices in the guest cabin on Saudia flights.\n</p>\n<table>\n    <caption class=\"accessible-hide\">POC approved models</caption>\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th colspan=\"2\">POC approved models</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Airsep FreeStyle 5</td>\n            <td>Airsep Focus</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Delphi RS-00400</td>\n            <td>Airsep Lifestyle</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Inogen One G3</td>\n            <td>Inogen One G2</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>SeQual SAROS</td>\n            <td>Invacare Solo2</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Oxygen Concentrator</td>\n            <td>Oxus RS-0400</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>SeQual Eclipse</td>\n            <td>Respironics EverGo</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>VBOX Trooper</td>\n            <td>AirSep FreeStyle</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Inogen One</td>\n            <td>DeVilbiss Healthcare iGo</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Respironics SimplyGo</td>\n            <td>Inova Labs LifeChoice</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Oxlife Independence</td>\n            <td>Invacare XPO2</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Precision Medical EasyPulse</td>\n            <td>Inova Labs LifeChoice Activox</td>\n        </tr>\n        <!-- Last 3 rows: kept as 2 columns -->\n        <tr>\n            <td>International Biophysics Corporation LifeChoice</td>\n            <td>—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>SeQual eQuinox Oxygen System (model 4000)</td>\n            <td>—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Oxywell Oxygen System (model 4000)</td>\n            <td>—</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"sb-subnote\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/gview?url=https://www.saudia.com/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/files/application%20of%20portable%20oxygen%20concentrator.pdf&amp;embedded=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Medical information form for using a portable oxygen concentrator (PDF)</a>\n</p>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-tabs class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-tab-container\"><mat-tab-group animationduration=\"0ms\" class=\"mat-tab-group mat-primary ng-star-inserted\"><mat-tab-header class=\"mat-tab-header\"><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-before mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button><div class=\"mat-tab-label-container\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"mat-tab-list\"><div class=\"mat-tab-labels\"><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator mat-tab-label-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"1\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Terms &amp; Conditions<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-36 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-36 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<ul class=\"ul-look\">\n  <li>\n    The device must comply with Saudi Food and Drug Authority (SFDA) requirements or display an approved safety mark for onboard use. Guests must provide supporting documents when requested.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    The guest must be able to hear alarms, see indicator lights, and respond to warnings, or travel with someone who can perform these actions on their behalf.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    The portable oxygen concentrator (POC) must be clean and free from oil, grease, or petroleum products, and in good condition with no visible damage.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    The device must not interfere with the aircraft’s electrical, navigation, or communication systems during taxi, take-off, cruise, or landing.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    The POC must be stowed securely under the seat in front of the guest or in an approved storage area. It must not block aisles, pathways, or emergency exits.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Only oxygen-approved creams, lotions, and salves may be used by guests using a POC.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Guests must send the Physician’s Statement (POC report) to \n    <a href=\"mailto:meda@saudia.com\">meda@saudia.com</a> at least 48 hours before departure.  \n    They must also check in no later than 3 hours before the flight with the device, batteries, and original medical report.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Guests should confirm the total flight duration with Saudia offices or the reservations call center to ensure they carry enough fully charged batteries for the entire journey.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Batteries for approved devices must be carried in hand baggage and protected from physical damage.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    A maximum of two spare batteries is permitted in carry-on baggage.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Batteries must be protected against short circuits—for example, by covering terminals or packing each battery separately.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    Guests must carry enough batteries to cover the full flight time plus at least 150% additional capacity.  \n    For example: a 10-hour flight requires batteries charged for at least 15 hours.\n  </li>\n\n  <li>\n    If the oxygen device is checked in, all batteries must be removed and carried in the guest’s hand baggage inside the cabin.\n  </li>\n</ul></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<p class=\"sb-note-box\">\n  <strong>Note:</strong>\n  Please avoid placing valuables or important documents in baggage checked into the aircraft hold.\n</p></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I travel with a wheelchair on Saudia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> Can I travel with a wheelchair on Saudia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Passengers may travel with wheelchairs and other mobility aids free of charge. Wheelchairs are typically checked and transported in the aircraft hold and returned upon arrival according to airport procedures.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Does Saudia allow medical equipment onboard?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> Does Saudia allow medical equipment onboard? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Saudia accepts medical equipment for passengers with disabilities or reduced mobility. Eligible medical equipment may be carried in addition to the standard baggage allowance, subject to applicable safety and handling requirements.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I travel with a portable oxygen concentrator (POC) on Saudia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> Can I travel with a portable oxygen concentrator (POC) on Saudia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Passengers with medical needs may use an approved Portable Oxygen Concentrator (POC) during the flight. The device must meet Saudia's requirements, and passengers should submit the required medical documentation before departure and carry sufficient battery power for the entire journey.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I travel with musical instruments on Saudia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> Can I travel with musical instruments on Saudia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Musical instruments are accepted as checked baggage when properly packed in a suitable protective case. Their weight counts toward the passenger's free baggage allowance, and excess baggage charges may apply if the allowance is exceeded.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Are mobility aids included in the free baggage allowance?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> Are mobility aids included in the free baggage allowance? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Approved mobility aids are carried free of charge and do not count toward the standard baggage allowance.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}